    {
      "id": "claim_1112badb0d714b2794476161772249ec",
      "statement": "The stream() and astream() methods route dynamically based on _should_stream() to implement streaming via _stream()/_astream(), fall back to invoke/ainvoke, or respect disable_streaming overrides; streaming is also gated by callback handlers that inherit _StreamingCallbackHandler and by explicit stream=true/false parameters.",
