    {
      "id": "claim_a3f0ca7655334ce5bae249f884ee9751",
      "statement": "The _generate_with_cache() and _agenerate_with_cache() methods transparently check the cache before calling _generate()/_agenerate(), zero-cost cache hits via usage_metadata.total_cost=0, apply rate limiting after cache check to avoid throttling hits, and replay v2 protocol events for cache hits when v2 handlers are attached.",
