      "id": "claim_8a2fb42f65994bd993295f7c1e2214b2",
      "statement": "The generate() and agenerate() methods accept list[list[BaseMessage]] and return LLMResult with aggregated ChatGeneration results, handling per-item caching, per-item error callbacks via on_llm_error, and concurrent execution for agenerate() via asyncio.gather().",
