      "id": "claim_f12a4315e8724b1d95da87a238df104c",
      "statement": "Subclasses must implement _generate() to call the provider API and return ChatResult; must provide _llm_type property for model identification; optionally implement _stream()/_astream() for native streaming, _agenerate() for async optimization, _identifying_params for serialization, and _resolve_model_profile() for capability discovery.",
