    {
      "id": "claim_01e68e4f08cd4834b91a5cd71cefe668",
      "statement": "bind_tools() is a provider-specific method that accepts tool definitions (dict, type, Callable, BaseTool) and returns a Runnable that embeds tool calls in AIMessage.additional_kwargs[\"tool_calls\"]; with_structured_output() uses bind_tools() internally to force schema-conformant output via PydanticToolsParser or JsonOutputKeyToolsParser, supporting include_raw mode for error capture.",
