    {
      "id": "claim_f524657ddfd94281b676468c30a24eb3",
      "statement": "When a _V2StreamingCallbackHandler is attached, _should_use_protocol_streaming() routes to v2 event path via _iter_v2_events()/_aiter_v2_events(), which dispatch via native _stream_chat_model_events()/_astream_chat_model_events() if implemented, else bridge _stream()/_astream() output via chunks_to_events()/achunks_to_events(), firing on_stream_event() per event.",
