      "id": "claim_2fdd60a7f9204b17bc781d838b98b864",
      "statement": "stream_events(version=\"v3\") and astream_events(version=\"v3\") return ChatModelStream/AsyncChatModelStream objects that lazily initialize the run manager on first consumption, accumulate protocol message events via dispatch(), apply rate limiting, and fire on_stream_event() per event.",
