    {
      "id": "claim_60f2878749bf451481549b2dc6dd44b3",
      "statement": "Messages are normalized via _normalize_messages() before passing to _stream()/_generate(); output version is controlled via output_version field ('v0' provider-specific, 'v1' standardized); messages may be formatted for tracing via _format_for_tracing() which converts image blocks to OpenAI format and adds type keys to content blocks.",
