      "id": "claim_f454536ecabd4091a9aa2d22575a26f1",
      "statement": "Model profiles are optional TypedDict structures loaded via _resolve_model_profile() during model initialization, validated by _check_profile_keys(), and cached via profile field; they declare capabilities like context_window, supported_modalities, tool_calling support, and structured_output support for runtime capability discovery.",
